{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1cbf1c98f78dd03230f410dc884460ac5832300c9611eb53d9b14cd841a2fb82", "ja": "静香とジュリア。亡き姉が繋いだ\n2人の運命は今、共鳴し、ぶつかり合い……\nそのハーモニーは、どこまでも飛んでいく。\nあの空へと届くように。", "zh": "静香与茱莉亚，\n两人的命运因逝去的姊姊而相系，\n而今共鸣并碰撞出火花……\n这份和声会飞向无垠，传达到那片天空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "04c39247c3ea99281a4dc7c4bd56adff5342d1f558ede10bfb85a886e3fe5696", "ja": "あんた、最上静香だろ？", "zh": "你，就是最上静香吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "f3ab229c7396511e2c75b0d291a88bede16d4ebfdcdc2374444dc4f0fa77d581", "ja": "そ……そう、ですけど。", "zh": "嗯……是、是我没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "bc4576a3e059ea24dcd8282e7ad5ae1ec5007e151e159ff47e9fc039ce46d189", "ja": "……あんた、あたしと一緒に歌わない？", "zh": "……你要不要，跟我一起唱歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "10b852e7d3cb4522aff242f773734fb2255dc0b410d1e5ed0b73323a6dbf1573", "ja": "……チハは、あたしの相棒だった。", "zh": "……千早曾是我的搭档。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "93baee042143cd321b42e58a62d654afa89d629b4744eaa83cfdc9f4756fe2a8", "ja": "お姉ちゃんの代わりに、私に歌え？\nよくそんなことが言えますね！？", "zh": "你让我代替姐姐唱歌？  \n真亏你说得出口！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "445b90967c56c094322f7324ef682ead5bce18e6ff4d6f06e9a508ac38d2d67c", "ja": "……チハの代わりになれなんて言ってない。\nあたしはあんたの歌に惚れ込んだんだ。", "zh": "……我可没叫你去当千羽的替身。\n我是被你的歌声给迷住了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "2f91e638342cd8cc399d7749f9481b48e4ea840f6db0dc887b6aa07da0e72467", "ja": "この曲……。", "zh": "这首歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "ff46f932104ac71c3b22bf62c3629980179ecbacb42d91cb8ae3605b035c84f7", "ja": "お姉ちゃんが、遊びだよっていって、弾いてた曲……。", "zh": "姐姐说着“这是玩耍”，弹奏过的曲子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "a542bfb4262970a579822af5100260d36b9c3f3263119a02c4a5cda443cc4742", "ja": "あたしは飛びたい。どこまでも飛んでみたい。あんたが\n自分で飛びたいって願うことに、理由があるのか？", "zh": "我想飞。想试着飞向无尽的远方。你想靠自己飞翔，这个愿望有什么理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "d99f7e6432231323747854dca3dffdca268035d67b30be041c7fc958cae1b5b6", "ja": "静香。あたしと、あんたの曲だ。", "zh": "静香。这是我和你的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "e7795b30ae0a178d8b0a98440b5d7951f3084c2eeeeb12f1248053a96e4e1cf0", "ja": "さあ、シズ。……行こうか。", "zh": "来吧，小静。……走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_07_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "59706ba9d1b24e271ebfdcdaf33975c4cc7ed06f75b373e486245c04999e4505", "ja": "ええ……。ジュリア", "zh": "嗯……茱莉亚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
